{"unit_id":"imlishiyuan__keep-reminder#feature-1","repo":"imlishiyuan/keep-reminder","commit":"ac0f17eb91389174d6039897dab080dadbb03ff7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"keep-reminder 的功能「按模式注入提醒」：从会话工作目录读取配置文件，并将非空内容作为 system-reminder 消息加入对话。可设为每个会话一次、每轮一次或每次请求一次。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:46-68","src/index.ts:72-79"]}
